{"availability":"available","full":"shyjun/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool","name":"git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool","description":"User-friendly GUI for git interactive rebasing, based on Python. A Python-based GUI tool for Git interactive rebase to streamline commit history management.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":7,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-21T10:28:05Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:15:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://shyjun.github.io/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/","topics":["git","git-rebase","git-rebase-gui","git-workflow","interactive-rebase"],"demo":"https://shyjun.github.io/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.417Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.417Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.417Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.417Z","stars":7,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A clean visual GUI for git rebase -i — reorder, squash, split, rephrase, drop, and refine commit history, plus browse any branch and cherry-pick commits — all with an intuitive interface.","A Python-based Git Interactive Rebase GUI tool to visually manage commit history. Built with PySide6, this tool simplifies the complex process of rewriting Git history with a faster and more visual workflow.","Keywords: git rebase gui, interactive rebase tool, git history editor, git squash commits gui, git cherry-pick gui"],"features":["Visual Reordering: Drag and drop commits to reorder your history, or use the Move Commit context-menu actions. In multi-select mode, drag a block of adjacent checked commits to a new position together.","Interactive Squash: Squash a commit with its neighbor, or multi-select any range of commits to squash into one — with a dedicated dialog and real-time feedback.","Multi-select Actions: Select multiple commits, then apply an action to all of them — Squash selected commits (any adjacent range), Mark selected commits, Drop selected commits (dropped one by one, newest first, with…","Smart Rephrase: Effortlessly update commit messages without leaving the app.","Instant Drop: Remove unwanted commits with a single click (with preview)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shyjun/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"f2b7eebeb8fa64090c16958d00d733f8874b95343c10fa2b8061bab35a94a558","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.497Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.497Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A clean visual GUI for git rebase -i — reorder, squash, split, rephrase, drop, and refine commit history, plus browse any branch and cherry-pick commits — all with an intuitive interface.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shyjun/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Browse File Log: Open a separate read-only window showing the history of a single file, via Browse File Log… in the Repo menu or Browse file log in the file-wise view's right-click menu.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shyjun/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f2b7eebeb8fa64090c16958d00d733f8874b95343c10fa2b8061bab35a94a558","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shyjun/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.498Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T07:15:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shyjun/git-interactive-rebase-gui-tool/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:45.500Z","hash":"f2b7eebeb8fa64090c16958d00d733f8874b95343c10fa2b8061bab35a94a558","originalBytes":21074,"storedBytes":21074,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["commit","git","commits","file","changes","diff","interactive","staged","files","tool","head","selected","branch","any","browse","history","rebase","repository","update","python3","rebase